# MESSAGE: an agent's real cwd assertion did NOT match its assigned worktree -- this is the false-findings failure mode named in the horizon report (a verify subagent running in the wrong cwd and reporting false results); abort that agent's findings and re-dispatch it into the correct worktree, never trust its output
PREFIX fleet: <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/agent-fleet-isolation#>
SELECT ?agentName ?actualToplevel WHERE {
  ?c a fleet:CwdAssertion ;
     fleet:agentName ?agentName ;
     fleet:matchesAssigned false .
  OPTIONAL { ?c fleet:actualToplevel ?actualToplevel }
}
ORDER BY ?agentName
